WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

00:05.050 --> 00:07.020
I've shown you the way.

00:07.260 --> 00:08.500
As for what to do,

00:08.660 --> 00:10.020
it's up to you.

00:10.050 --> 00:12.510
Choose the long shot of a lifetime together,

00:12.540 --> 00:13.700
or give up the lover

00:13.900 --> 00:14.980
for the Three Realms?

00:14.980 --> 00:15.510
Liu Shao.

00:15.860 --> 00:17.460
You have to make a choice.

00:17.900 --> 00:22.690
[Chapter about Liu Shao]

01:48.990 --> 01:57.690
[Song of the Moon]

01:57.770 --> 02:00.670
[Episode 39]

02:13.600 --> 02:16.260
It turns out that everything is already doomed.

02:16.920 --> 02:17.880
My fate

02:19.000 --> 02:21.460
has already been changed to the Three Realms

02:21.800 --> 02:23.400
by the three-day agreement.

02:26.600 --> 02:27.200
Turns out

02:28.360 --> 02:30.000
a dramatic life

02:31.440 --> 02:32.970
means such sacrifices.

02:35.490 --> 02:36.720
The God of the Sun

02:37.760 --> 02:39.840
must have felt the same way I do now.

02:41.960 --> 02:43.720
He chose to use the Moon Sword,

02:44.360 --> 02:47.020
in an attempt to save the Moonlight a ray of life.

02:48.160 --> 02:49.170
So,

02:50.640 --> 02:52.300
the God of Moonlight wanted me

02:54.160 --> 02:55.160
to kill Luo Ge

02:56.680 --> 02:58.160
with the Crown Wheel?

03:00.400 --> 03:01.360
Liu Shao.

03:02.320 --> 03:04.040
It's a cruel choice.

03:05.240 --> 03:07.720
Should I leave you in the misery forever?

03:09.160 --> 03:10.040
Maybe

03:10.520 --> 03:11.960
it's the best

03:12.360 --> 03:14.080
if I do it.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.940
Immortal Liu Shao is back!

03:18.650 --> 03:19.410
Tell her

03:19.760 --> 03:20.840
I'm in retreat.

03:23.240 --> 03:25.240
I'll take care of the arrangements.

03:27.680 --> 03:28.400
Oh.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.480
What's wrong, Luo Ge?

03:31.400 --> 03:33.060
Care about your little bride?

03:33.490 --> 03:34.280
Shut up!

03:35.280 --> 03:37.140
Even the Moonlight can't kill me.

03:37.920 --> 03:39.440
You think you can?

03:41.050 --> 03:43.050
The God of Moonlight didn't kill you

03:43.960 --> 03:45.680
because Sun's kindness.

03:46.640 --> 03:48.800
Liu Shao's gonna kill you this time.

03:52.880 --> 03:54.680
It's a pity you don't have time.

04:03.840 --> 04:05.160
The Three Realms

04:08.040 --> 04:10.160
will be mine.

04:27.440 --> 04:29.100
Why are you still carrying it?

04:32.360 --> 04:33.000
It's

04:33.600 --> 04:34.860
a constant reminder of

04:36.920 --> 04:38.010
what I did to you,

04:40.560 --> 04:41.170
and

04:43.200 --> 04:44.880
what I did to Luo Ning.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.800
You don't have to wear it.

04:58.200 --> 05:00.530
If you can keep your pure and honest heart,

05:01.000 --> 05:01.860
it'll be enough

05:02.720 --> 05:03.480
for me

05:04.560 --> 05:05.360
and Luo Ning.

05:13.480 --> 05:14.680
I'm sorry.

05:25.800 --> 05:27.860
No matter what happens in the future,

05:29.240 --> 05:32.640
you should remember your duty to the Demon King's bloodline.

05:52.080 --> 05:52.960
Fu,

05:54.000 --> 05:55.360
protecting your people

05:56.720 --> 05:58.850
is what you do for the rest of your life.

06:00.600 --> 06:01.120
Yes.

06:02.680 --> 06:03.600
I know.

06:12.930 --> 06:17.010
[Wedding]

06:25.680 --> 06:26.450
Luo Ge.

06:28.160 --> 06:29.280
We made a deal.

06:30.610 --> 06:32.610
You're the only one I'm gonna marry.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.720
I'm sure you'll come back.

07:05.200 --> 07:05.840
Liu Shao.

07:08.520 --> 07:09.200
He Na.

07:10.330 --> 07:12.390
I didn't think you were gonna make it.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.080
You're getting married to Luo Ge.

07:14.080 --> 07:15.210
How could I not come?

07:17.520 --> 07:18.450
But this time...

07:22.040 --> 07:24.080
But this time to come to the Immortal Palace,

07:24.080 --> 07:26.040
I still have some things in the demon world.

07:26.040 --> 07:27.240
So I was a little late.

07:28.280 --> 07:28.920
No.

07:34.730 --> 07:36.040
I've been thinking about

07:36.040 --> 07:37.560
getting you a big wedding gift.

07:37.560 --> 07:39.420
And maybe this is the perfect one.

07:46.520 --> 07:47.840
Clear Vine?

07:48.720 --> 07:51.650
This Clear Vine was born in the extremely cold place.

07:51.840 --> 07:54.840
It seems that it's only found in the Bone Melting Pool.

07:55.480 --> 07:56.170
He Na.

07:57.080 --> 07:58.520
How did you get this?

08:08.480 --> 08:09.760
There are also places like the Bone Melting Pools

08:09.760 --> 08:11.240
in the demon world.

08:12.600 --> 08:14.600
But, Liu Shao, you have to remember.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.250
To refine this vine,

08:17.480 --> 08:19.080
it must be in the demon world.

08:24.090 --> 08:24.800
He Na.

08:26.040 --> 08:26.760
Thank you.

08:41.840 --> 08:42.409
Liu Shao.

08:44.720 --> 08:46.050
No matter what happens,

08:48.290 --> 08:51.010
Luo Ge and I are right behind you.

08:56.320 --> 08:57.360
Be safe.

09:00.010 --> 09:00.560
He Na.

09:02.040 --> 09:03.960
Do you already have a plan?

09:07.320 --> 09:08.360
After today,

09:08.800 --> 09:10.000
you go to the demon world,

09:10.000 --> 09:11.200
refining the Clear Vine

09:11.200 --> 09:12.930
and restarting the Sun Spirit.

09:13.250 --> 09:14.160
I'm sure

09:15.440 --> 09:17.160
Luo Ge won't leave you alone.

09:45.210 --> 09:45.920
Okay.

09:54.120 --> 09:54.890
Liu Shao.

09:56.770 --> 09:58.080
From this day forward,

09:59.160 --> 10:00.720
you are mine.

10:05.680 --> 10:06.760
Supreme God Luo Ge.

10:07.560 --> 10:09.360
The wedding is not yet complete.

10:09.440 --> 10:10.840
Please behave yourself.

10:11.120 --> 10:12.580
Don't you dare disobey me?

10:14.480 --> 10:15.290
But...

10:16.440 --> 10:17.900
The more you act like this,

10:18.960 --> 10:20.240
the more I like you.

10:21.160 --> 10:22.240
Supreme God Luo Ge

10:22.520 --> 10:23.780
is of a noble character

10:24.360 --> 10:25.840
and observes all manners.

10:26.760 --> 10:28.160
Of course you don't care.

10:42.520 --> 10:43.120
Okay.

10:45.160 --> 10:46.760
Let's follow the etiquette.

10:48.010 --> 10:49.160
My little bride.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.640
Please.

11:15.800 --> 11:16.760
My little bride.

11:18.000 --> 11:19.440
Do you want to die?

11:21.010 --> 11:22.560
Or

11:23.770 --> 11:25.600
you want the Immortal Palace

11:27.440 --> 11:29.080
to die with you?

11:33.920 --> 11:35.200
Where's Luo Ge?

11:39.560 --> 11:41.610
If you'll marry me nicely,

11:43.290 --> 11:44.840
and serve me well,

11:46.200 --> 11:48.130
I'll let him come out to see you.

11:53.810 --> 11:55.520
I'm in a good mood today

11:56.560 --> 11:58.320
and I suggest you play along.

11:59.960 --> 12:02.020
I don't want to sacrifice their blood

12:02.850 --> 12:04.400
on this wedding day.

12:06.280 --> 12:07.120
Pretty,

12:08.440 --> 12:09.480
what do you think?

12:45.290 --> 12:46.080
Today

12:46.770 --> 12:48.250
is my wedding day.

12:49.090 --> 12:50.290
Don't just sit there.

12:50.730 --> 12:51.760
Have a drink.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.800
Pour my wine, please.

13:15.840 --> 13:16.840
You pour the wine.

13:25.040 --> 13:26.520
This is way out of line.

13:26.690 --> 13:28.150
Are we just gonna sit here?

13:29.410 --> 13:31.470
Let's just wait and see what happens.

13:35.560 --> 13:36.440
Keep pouring.

14:06.040 --> 14:06.770
Supreme God.

14:11.010 --> 14:11.800
What is it?

14:14.920 --> 14:16.400
I have one thing to report,

14:17.330 --> 14:20.200
about the God of the Sun and Sun Spirit.

14:20.690 --> 14:21.490
It's said that

14:22.410 --> 14:23.450
the God of the Sun

14:23.560 --> 14:25.360
has passed down some secrets

14:25.600 --> 14:26.880
concerning you

14:27.320 --> 14:28.580
by some secret method.

14:29.290 --> 14:30.240
Secret?

14:30.840 --> 14:32.210
I wonder

14:32.400 --> 14:35.200
if you could walk to the Palace Chonghua for a chat.

14:36.520 --> 14:37.690
I'd like to see

14:38.640 --> 14:41.050
if you have any skeletons in your closet.

14:46.000 --> 14:46.840
Liu Shao.

14:48.280 --> 14:49.000
Wait for me.

15:06.640 --> 15:07.530
If the God of the Sun had left behind

15:07.530 --> 15:09.730
a secret way of dealing with this demon,

15:11.000 --> 15:13.200
I should have seen it in the Crown Wheel.

15:14.000 --> 15:14.960
Or...

15:16.320 --> 15:17.610
This is what he meant

15:18.600 --> 15:21.000
Luo Ge isn't gonna let this wedding happen?

15:27.760 --> 15:28.530
Tell me.

15:30.290 --> 15:32.550
What kind of secrets did the God of the Sun

15:32.970 --> 15:34.680
tell you through secrecy?

15:35.330 --> 15:36.930
Don't you wonder?

15:37.850 --> 15:39.180
Ten thousand years ago,

15:39.250 --> 15:42.050
Sun Spirit was clearly sealed by the God of the Sun,

15:42.480 --> 15:43.520
but then

15:44.480 --> 15:46.560
why did it wake up in Liu Shao's body?

15:47.120 --> 15:48.930
The God of the Sun opened it in secret.

15:48.930 --> 15:49.570
No.

15:52.600 --> 15:54.000
I heard from Liu Shao that

16:01.000 --> 16:03.320
it was the God of Moonlight.

16:04.050 --> 16:05.040
Impossible.

16:06.010 --> 16:08.670
Ten thousand years ago, the God of Moonlight...

16:15.520 --> 16:17.250
Don't you dare plot against me?

17:12.240 --> 17:13.010
He Na!

17:14.720 --> 17:15.770
He Na.

17:16.839 --> 17:17.410
He Na.

17:17.920 --> 17:18.490
He Na.

17:20.170 --> 17:21.369
He Na, please wake up.

17:23.200 --> 17:23.960
He Na.

17:32.680 --> 17:33.680
He Na.

17:42.170 --> 17:43.250
He Na!

17:54.010 --> 17:54.770
Liu Shao.

17:54.310 --> 17:58.360
♫The wind is getting slower, while the pear flowers are dropping♫

17:56.320 --> 17:57.240
Don't be sad.

17:58.820 --> 18:02.380
♫The silver color is cold and sharp♫

18:00.090 --> 18:02.080
I just... didn't want...

18:03.010 --> 18:04.650
didn't want that evil thing

18:06.680 --> 18:08.080
to hurt you

18:07.000 --> 18:10.840
♫On the top of Heaven and between reincarnation♫

18:09.090 --> 18:10.410
and the people

18:10.770 --> 18:12.120
in the name of Luo Ge.

18:11.380 --> 18:14.890
♫The moon is like snow♫

18:13.400 --> 18:14.080
He Na.

18:14.170 --> 18:15.040
So.

18:19.580 --> 18:23.630
♫I carve our appointment in three days between my eyebrows♫

18:20.050 --> 18:21.400
So I just

18:21.400 --> 18:22.970
did what I wanted.

18:24.000 --> 18:27.880
♫I walk through time with you♫

18:24.800 --> 18:25.600
I didn't...

18:27.640 --> 18:29.560
I didn't regret it.

18:30.290 --> 18:31.810
But I regret it.

18:30.850 --> 18:34.340
♫On the day when seas sink♫

18:32.280 --> 18:34.680
I regret having picked up that fish.

18:34.720 --> 18:43.330
♫When the moon never rests, the mortal world♫

18:40.320 --> 18:41.290
Miss Liu Shao.

18:41.760 --> 18:42.600
My name is Kho.

18:42.730 --> 18:43.640
I'm your demon.

18:43.680 --> 18:50.100
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

18:44.320 --> 18:46.120
If I hadn't picked up that fish,

18:46.120 --> 18:47.570
you wouldn't be like this

18:47.570 --> 18:49.960
and it wouldn't be where it is today.

18:50.100 --> 18:52.830
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

18:52.830 --> 18:56.300
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

18:56.300 --> 19:02.560
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

19:02.560 --> 19:09.880
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

19:11.530 --> 19:12.280
You said that

19:12.880 --> 19:14.410
the Water Hyacinth accessory

19:14.410 --> 19:16.010
was only for the Demon Queen.

19:16.240 --> 19:18.890
I hope that when the curse is lifted,

19:19.250 --> 19:20.200
you and Luo Ning

19:20.730 --> 19:22.760
can find your own happiness.

19:27.050 --> 19:28.090
I...

19:28.600 --> 19:30.080
I'd love to do what you say.

19:31.490 --> 19:33.620
Give this Water Hyacinth jade pendant

19:34.370 --> 19:36.050
to my Demon Queen.

19:35.400 --> 19:39.450
♫The wind is getting slower, while the pear flowers are dropping♫

19:37.570 --> 19:38.630
Unfortunately...

19:39.910 --> 19:43.470
♫The silver color is cold and sharp♫

19:40.770 --> 19:42.320
Unfortunately, I...

19:43.690 --> 19:45.170
I never

19:45.600 --> 19:46.480
gave it away.

19:46.520 --> 19:47.450
He Na.

19:48.090 --> 19:51.930
♫On the top of Heaven and between reincarnation♫

19:48.290 --> 19:49.730
I can only give it to you

19:51.080 --> 19:52.600
as a souvenir.

19:52.470 --> 19:55.980
♫The moon is like snow♫

19:55.720 --> 19:56.490
Sorry.

19:58.200 --> 19:59.260
It can no longer...

20:00.490 --> 20:01.440
It can no longer...

20:00.670 --> 20:04.720
♫I carve our appointment in three days between my eyebrows♫

20:02.680 --> 20:04.080
summon your demon.

20:04.930 --> 20:06.080
I don't want to summon you.

20:05.090 --> 20:08.970
♫I walk through time with you♫

20:06.080 --> 20:08.650
I just want you to be well. He Na.

20:11.940 --> 20:15.430
♫On the day when seas sink♫

20:15.810 --> 20:24.420
♫When the moon never rests, the mortal world♫

20:24.770 --> 20:31.190
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

20:25.960 --> 20:26.690
He Na.

20:29.560 --> 20:30.600
He Na.

20:31.190 --> 20:33.920
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

20:32.520 --> 20:33.520
He Na.

20:33.920 --> 20:37.390
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

20:34.770 --> 20:36.280
Don't leave me, okay?

20:37.390 --> 20:43.650
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

20:41.080 --> 20:41.920
Liu Shao.

20:43.650 --> 20:50.970
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

20:44.810 --> 20:45.850
Don't cry.

20:48.410 --> 20:49.320
Your demon

20:50.760 --> 20:51.440
is willing to

20:51.300 --> 20:54.380
♫You left my heart. You are my fate♫

20:52.410 --> 20:53.210
trade his body

20:54.380 --> 20:57.260
♫You are like dreams as if you disappear♫

20:54.930 --> 20:55.840
and his life

20:56.920 --> 20:57.720
for

20:57.490 --> 21:00.730
♫Two sides are round. You are like the moon at 11 pm♫

20:59.330 --> 21:00.370
your

21:00.730 --> 21:03.160
♫You are my fate♫

21:02.410 --> 21:03.360
eternal

21:03.160 --> 21:08.400
♫Look at the three realms. Look at the wilderness♫

21:05.720 --> 21:06.610
peace.

21:07.250 --> 21:08.200
He Na.

21:08.580 --> 21:10.950
♫Our old fate has become a cocoon♫

21:10.720 --> 21:11.930
He Na.

21:10.950 --> 21:18.470
♫The rest of life is no match  for a second♫

21:18.470 --> 21:24.810
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

21:18.920 --> 21:20.840
He Na!

21:21.440 --> 21:22.720
He Na!

21:24.810 --> 21:27.650
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

21:27.650 --> 21:31.090
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

21:28.050 --> 21:29.000
He Na.

21:30.610 --> 21:31.560
He Na.

21:31.090 --> 21:37.510
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

21:32.330 --> 21:33.170
He Na.

21:33.640 --> 21:34.880
He Na!

21:37.510 --> 21:43.820
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

21:38.410 --> 21:39.520
Keep this pendant

21:39.650 --> 21:40.730
close to you.

21:41.040 --> 21:42.650
When you need me in the future,

21:42.650 --> 21:43.960
just call out my name

21:43.820 --> 21:54.280
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

21:44.490 --> 21:45.330
and I will appear.

21:45.330 --> 21:46.080
He Na.

21:46.240 --> 21:47.570
What are you doing here?

21:47.610 --> 21:48.490
If you are in danger,

21:48.490 --> 21:50.080
the Water Hyacinth will summon me.

21:50.080 --> 21:50.920
Are you okay?

21:53.090 --> 21:53.930
Liu Shao.

21:54.130 --> 21:55.590
Next time you fall asleep,

21:55.680 --> 21:56.610
remind yourself

21:57.200 --> 21:58.200
to wake up.

21:59.240 --> 22:00.160
Someone

22:00.600 --> 22:01.400
loves you

22:02.400 --> 22:03.530
and values your life

22:04.320 --> 22:05.560
more than his own.

22:22.330 --> 22:23.970
He Na.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.330
He Na.

22:34.840 --> 22:35.600
Enough!

22:36.770 --> 22:38.230
What is there to cry about?

22:38.800 --> 22:39.600
Because your little lover

22:39.600 --> 22:40.610
didn't kill me?

22:40.610 --> 22:41.450
Shut up!

22:52.040 --> 22:52.570
So.

22:53.450 --> 22:54.850
You want to avenge He Na?

22:55.130 --> 22:55.690
Yes.

22:56.170 --> 22:58.010
I want to avenge He Na.

22:58.650 --> 23:00.570
I want justice for Luo Ge.

23:01.370 --> 23:02.890
You have no right to do anything

23:02.890 --> 23:04.490
and harm anyone in the world

23:04.810 --> 23:06.050
with his body.

23:06.250 --> 23:07.730
But I'm Luo Ge now.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.720
I could use his hands

23:09.720 --> 23:11.200
to punish his best brother,

23:11.200 --> 23:12.600
kill his best friend,

23:12.970 --> 23:13.680
and even

23:14.170 --> 23:15.630
marry his favorite woman.

23:18.050 --> 23:19.710
What are you gonna do about me?

23:20.130 --> 23:21.370
I will kill you.

23:22.650 --> 23:24.250
I will kill you!

23:25.240 --> 23:27.450
I'll wipe you out of this world,

23:27.450 --> 23:28.770
without a trace.

23:30.570 --> 23:32.400
It seems that if I don't give you this chance today,

23:32.400 --> 23:33.880
you won't give up.

23:34.330 --> 23:35.250
How about this?

23:35.610 --> 23:36.800
Let's make a bet

23:37.370 --> 23:39.720
that you can kill me.

23:40.850 --> 23:42.330
Immortal Liu Shao.

23:43.520 --> 23:44.210
Okay.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.560
You can rest assured that

23:46.730 --> 23:47.890
I will do it.

23:49.970 --> 23:51.850
If you can't do it,

23:54.970 --> 23:57.400
you'll have to be my wife

23:58.040 --> 23:59.520
and serve me every day.

24:00.010 --> 24:01.870
You can't think of anything else.

24:02.970 --> 24:04.170
Do you dare to say yes?

24:05.320 --> 24:05.850
Okay,

24:06.730 --> 24:07.330
I agree.

24:08.370 --> 24:10.090
Then I'll give you three days.

24:11.010 --> 24:12.120
If you renege on that promise,

24:12.120 --> 24:13.530
or break it later,

24:14.000 --> 24:16.060
I'll make sure your family, friends,

24:16.960 --> 24:18.440
and the Immortal Palace that Luo Ge cares about,

24:18.440 --> 24:20.170
and even the whole Three Realms

24:20.810 --> 24:22.690
die.

24:23.370 --> 24:24.500
I won't stand you up.

24:25.560 --> 24:26.530
In three days,

24:28.040 --> 24:28.970
I will kill you

24:29.520 --> 24:30.730
once and for all.

25:37.970 --> 25:40.210
When my brother came back from the Immortal Palace,

25:40.210 --> 25:41.890
he told me something.

25:42.610 --> 25:43.320
Fu,

25:43.810 --> 25:44.930
one day,

25:44.930 --> 25:46.410
if anything happens to me,

25:46.810 --> 25:48.160
you must do your best

25:48.690 --> 25:49.770
to protect Liu Shao

25:50.490 --> 25:52.090
and help her ascend to the god

25:52.450 --> 25:53.930
to seal the evil spirits.

25:55.570 --> 25:56.450
He and Luo Ge

25:57.800 --> 26:00.800
had already made all kinds of preparations and plans.

26:05.410 --> 26:06.490
So He Na's death

26:07.370 --> 26:08.900
was also part of their plan?

26:16.210 --> 26:17.610
They died

26:18.450 --> 26:19.440
just for

26:20.210 --> 26:21.690
the chance of winning.

26:29.320 --> 26:30.090
Liu Shao.

26:32.040 --> 26:33.810
You are their silver lining.

26:35.330 --> 26:37.450
Don't let them die in vain.

26:38.360 --> 26:39.970
Don't let

26:40.290 --> 26:41.290
the Three Realms,

26:41.890 --> 26:42.610
people,

26:43.400 --> 26:45.530
and friends they're trying to protect

26:45.610 --> 26:47.800
perish in the evil spirits.

26:49.480 --> 26:50.520
For today's plan,

26:51.090 --> 26:53.130
you must refine the Clear Vine as soon as possible,

26:53.130 --> 26:54.650
break through the seal of divine spirit

26:54.650 --> 26:55.850
and ascend to the god,

26:56.170 --> 26:57.970
so as to control that evil thing.

27:06.370 --> 27:06.920
Girl,

27:07.010 --> 27:09.090
I have helped you dredge the meridians with the needle.

27:09.090 --> 27:10.210
It can help the Clear Vine

27:10.210 --> 27:11.210
break the seal,

27:11.610 --> 27:13.000
but it will also make your pain worse.

27:13.000 --> 27:14.200
You have to suck it up.

27:57.320 --> 27:59.250
There's nothing going on in there.

27:59.480 --> 28:00.850
Is everything okay?

28:02.490 --> 28:03.750
I'll go and take a look.

28:04.010 --> 28:05.080
No need.

28:09.490 --> 28:10.330
Let me in.

28:15.930 --> 28:16.720
Let him in.

28:17.010 --> 28:17.690
This

28:17.960 --> 28:19.890
is the real Immortal Master Wanwu.

29:17.000 --> 29:19.010
Supreme God Liu Shao.

29:19.850 --> 29:21.780
It's starting to get interesting.

29:22.730 --> 29:24.760
The three-day wait was not in vain.

29:25.360 --> 29:27.250
The thought of you living three more days

29:27.250 --> 29:28.530
under the name of Luo Ge

29:29.250 --> 29:30.680
makes me sick.

29:32.690 --> 29:33.690
Fortunately,

29:34.370 --> 29:35.970
it ends today.

30:55.290 --> 30:56.130
Luo Ge.

31:06.920 --> 31:07.720
Liu Shao.

31:27.610 --> 31:28.370
Liu Shao.

31:30.240 --> 31:31.440
I remember I told you.

31:32.250 --> 31:33.850
If you were the God of the Sun,

31:34.090 --> 31:35.350
what would you choose?

31:36.960 --> 31:38.370
I don't want you to waver.

31:39.290 --> 31:40.850
So you kept it from me,

31:41.410 --> 31:43.090
hoping to make me think that

31:43.480 --> 31:44.570
I was splitting

31:45.650 --> 31:47.250
the heart of that evil thing,

31:48.920 --> 31:50.250
not your heart.

31:52.210 --> 31:53.560
Now I'm Luo Ge.

31:54.050 --> 31:56.310
But after tonight, I'll be an evil thing.

31:56.730 --> 31:59.130
I'll bring the Three Realms to an eternal night.

31:59.130 --> 32:00.570
And I'll bring death

32:00.810 --> 32:02.470
to all the people of the world.

32:02.850 --> 32:03.640
Liu Shao.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.610
You know me

32:06.530 --> 32:07.640
and you love me.

32:08.930 --> 32:11.060
You should know that I would rather die

32:12.330 --> 32:14.610
than put myself in that situation.

32:15.770 --> 32:17.080
That evil thing

32:17.890 --> 32:18.930
killed He Na?

32:20.930 --> 32:21.570
Yes.

32:22.410 --> 32:24.090
If you can't do it,

32:24.770 --> 32:27.300
it will kill everyone in the Immortal Palace.

32:27.450 --> 32:29.090
So you've been sober

32:30.520 --> 32:32.200
since He Na died?

32:33.210 --> 32:35.540
You soberly urged me to be the Supreme God,

32:36.600 --> 32:37.650
so that

32:40.090 --> 32:41.810
I could kill you

32:43.250 --> 32:44.650
and seal that evil thing?

32:47.560 --> 32:48.290
I'm sorry.

32:49.170 --> 32:50.210
Only you

32:51.610 --> 32:52.850
can do it.

32:58.570 --> 32:59.850
Did He Na know?

33:01.730 --> 33:02.770
He Na's death

33:04.410 --> 33:06.670
and everything that happened after that

33:08.090 --> 33:09.750
was a plot between He Na and me.

33:10.170 --> 33:10.810
He Na.

33:12.090 --> 33:13.010
Soon,

33:14.130 --> 33:15.410
the Luo Ge you see

33:16.050 --> 33:17.600
may not be the real Luo Ge.

33:18.610 --> 33:20.340
We all have someone to protect,

33:20.890 --> 33:22.550
my people and the demon world,

33:23.040 --> 33:25.120
your immortal palace and the Three Realms.

33:25.120 --> 33:26.320
My days are numbered.

33:27.880 --> 33:29.210
But even if I were to die,

33:30.050 --> 33:32.050
I would not tolerate that evil thing

33:32.650 --> 33:34.450
trampling on those I care about.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.210
I can die,

33:38.170 --> 33:39.570
but I will not tolerate

33:41.760 --> 33:44.090
that evil thing trampling on... in my name

33:44.410 --> 33:46.450
to trample on all that I hold dear.

33:49.760 --> 33:51.690
If we work together,

33:52.480 --> 33:54.340
what chance do we have of winning?

33:58.360 --> 33:59.890
We don't even have a chance.

34:03.490 --> 34:04.440
What?

34:05.520 --> 34:08.330
But if Liu Shao can train herself to be the Supreme God,

34:08.330 --> 34:09.280
she can kill me

34:10.960 --> 34:13.620
and she will be able to pass on the seal of the Sun,

34:14.850 --> 34:17.909
and seal the evil spirits in the Four Seasons Monument.

34:18.210 --> 34:19.330
That way,

34:21.370 --> 34:24.170
the Three Realms and everything we want to protect

34:24.810 --> 34:26.409
and those we value

34:27.130 --> 34:28.400
will be preserved.

34:28.929 --> 34:30.989
Even if Liu Shao were the Supreme God,

34:31.730 --> 34:34.060
she would be no match for that evil spirit.

34:34.080 --> 34:35.090
Besides,

34:35.889 --> 34:37.690
the evil spirit is in your heart.

34:37.690 --> 34:39.090
To cut off the evil spirit

34:39.210 --> 34:41.199
is to cut off your own vitality.

34:44.800 --> 34:47.199
Liu Shao wouldn't have the guts to kill you.

34:51.650 --> 34:52.690
What if

34:54.040 --> 34:55.969
I pretend to be the Black Moonlight

34:56.290 --> 34:57.400
and let her kill me?

34:59.450 --> 35:00.560
She's too smart

35:01.490 --> 35:02.970
to be fooled that easily.

35:03.680 --> 35:04.760
Unless

35:12.090 --> 35:13.950
the real Black Moonlight appears

35:15.650 --> 35:17.850
and kills her most valued friend.

35:25.360 --> 35:27.160
On the night before the wedding,

35:28.650 --> 35:30.780
I could hardly control my evil spirit.

35:31.610 --> 35:33.410
I sealed myself here

35:34.330 --> 35:35.770
to preserve my power.

35:37.410 --> 35:38.690
But I don't know

35:38.690 --> 35:40.210
what happened after that.

35:41.610 --> 35:43.440
He Na had a deal with me.

35:44.570 --> 35:45.490
He said

35:46.360 --> 35:48.290
he would deal with that evil thing.

35:48.480 --> 35:49.570
If he dies,

35:51.090 --> 35:53.330
he will pass his water power to me.

36:01.250 --> 36:03.910
His water energy has the power to clear the mind,

36:04.170 --> 36:05.880
awaken me temporarily.

36:06.530 --> 36:08.730
But it will only last three days at most.

36:09.170 --> 36:10.660
He Na gave his life

36:11.480 --> 36:13.190
to help me get the three days,

36:13.760 --> 36:16.090
so that you could have a chance to become a Supreme God

36:16.090 --> 36:17.640
to seal the evil spirit.

36:20.610 --> 36:21.490
Why?

36:23.010 --> 36:24.970
Why sacrifice the two of you?

36:26.280 --> 36:27.810
Did it ever occur to you that

36:28.400 --> 36:30.600
whether this scheme succeeds or fails,

36:31.760 --> 36:33.490
you will both die?

36:35.050 --> 36:37.200
Our lives are nothing

36:37.530 --> 36:40.250
compared to the peace and security of the Three Realms and the people.

36:40.250 --> 36:41.250
Liu Shao.

36:42.130 --> 36:43.170
I trust you.

36:45.290 --> 36:46.970
You won't fail me and He Na,

36:46.970 --> 36:47.480
right?

36:51.130 --> 36:52.330
You don't have to provoke me.

36:52.330 --> 36:53.600
I don't blame you

36:54.170 --> 36:56.100
for keeping this decision from me.

36:57.530 --> 37:01.050
Because I'm not intending to ask your permission for what I'm about to do either.

37:01.050 --> 37:02.690
for what I'm about to do.

37:06.970 --> 37:07.680
Liu Shao.

37:15.490 --> 37:16.410
If you die,

37:17.410 --> 37:19.440
that evil thing will not necessarily die.

37:19.440 --> 37:21.100
It may break through the seal.

37:21.650 --> 37:22.810
But when I die,

37:24.650 --> 37:26.050
it dies

37:26.770 --> 37:28.130
with me.

37:32.050 --> 37:32.970
Luo Ge.

37:34.610 --> 37:36.450
I remember when you were Lu Li,

37:34.740 --> 37:37.850
♫On rainy days, wind blows smoke♫

37:37.250 --> 37:38.410
you're good at doing calculations.

37:37.850 --> 37:39.940
♫Into circles♫

37:39.330 --> 37:40.660
You know better than I do

37:41.070 --> 37:43.920
♫On both sides, I'm chanting♫

37:42.530 --> 37:43.930
how to choose, don't you?

37:44.220 --> 37:46.020
♫The night is sleepless♫

37:47.330 --> 37:50.340
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

37:50.480 --> 37:52.650
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

37:53.100 --> 37:58.470
♫Your promise, my fate♫

38:00.050 --> 38:03.260
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

38:01.450 --> 38:02.410
No.

38:03.270 --> 38:05.320
♫But my heart is still the same♫

38:04.130 --> 38:04.970
No.

38:05.570 --> 38:06.610
No!

38:06.400 --> 38:09.470
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

38:07.900 --> 38:09.680
The evil spirit is Yin in nature,

38:09.470 --> 38:11.040
♫Is like the things we went through♫

38:09.970 --> 38:12.370
clashes with the sun spirit.

38:12.690 --> 38:15.380
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

38:12.770 --> 38:14.770
If you absorb it,

38:15.170 --> 38:18.370
you'll die.

38:15.760 --> 38:17.700
♫The moment we passed each other♫

38:18.380 --> 38:24.100
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

38:18.920 --> 38:20.090
I will die.

38:21.010 --> 38:22.010
But Luo Ge

38:23.170 --> 38:24.330
will live.

38:24.480 --> 38:29.800
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

38:24.850 --> 38:26.930
Make your decision.

38:30.760 --> 38:36.810
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

38:32.770 --> 38:33.690
No.

38:35.450 --> 38:37.400
No!

38:37.200 --> 38:43.430
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

38:39.650 --> 38:40.560
Liu Shao.

38:41.570 --> 38:43.650
You are not Sun's shadow.

38:43.430 --> 38:49.640
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

38:44.250 --> 38:47.570
Only you can end this.

38:49.640 --> 38:54.950
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

38:55.950 --> 39:01.920
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

39:02.210 --> 39:08.310
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

39:07.830 --> 39:08.490
Liu Shao.

39:08.680 --> 39:15.030
♫If you see me for the first time in this life, I'll forever hold it in my heart♫

39:15.780 --> 39:18.680
♫Get lost in your sky♫

39:18.900 --> 39:21.490
♫Whose wilderness♫

39:21.490 --> 39:22.540
Ten thousand years ago,

39:22.100 --> 39:26.880
♫Clouds billow up and fade away in the four seas♫

39:24.260 --> 39:26.150
Sun killed what he loved.

39:27.160 --> 39:28.510
Ten thousand years later,

39:28.510 --> 39:31.540
♫The mountains and rivers after the farewell♫

39:29.850 --> 39:31.570
I can finally protect you.

39:31.540 --> 39:33.810
♫Silence♫

39:33.170 --> 39:34.390
I don't need your protection.

39:33.810 --> 39:36.290
♫Time sighs silently♫

39:35.600 --> 39:36.740
I don't regret it.

39:36.290 --> 39:41.170
♫Whose passing years♫

39:38.800 --> 39:40.480
Don't blame me, okay?

39:42.370 --> 39:43.000
After all,

39:45.050 --> 39:46.310
to live alone

39:47.410 --> 39:49.380
is far crueler than

39:50.560 --> 39:52.490
to die and feel nothing after that.

39:57.400 --> 39:57.930
Liu Shao.

39:59.420 --> 40:00.380
Sorry.

40:01.310 --> 40:02.190
Luo Ge.

40:02.650 --> 40:03.530
No.

40:04.790 --> 40:05.720
Liu Shao.

40:07.860 --> 40:08.740
Liu Shao.

40:11.910 --> 40:17.230
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

40:15.080 --> 40:16.550
I won't let you die.

40:17.480 --> 40:18.360
I won't.

40:18.170 --> 40:24.340
♫Looking back at the love that still remains in your past life♫

40:24.430 --> 40:30.420
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

40:27.980 --> 40:29.740
I won't let you die.

40:30.610 --> 40:36.270
♫ The year of my life fleets♫

40:36.540 --> 40:37.430
Luo Ge.

40:36.850 --> 40:46.810
♫Whose year is it♫

40:39.060 --> 40:40.240
Can you

40:41.670 --> 40:44.820
fly the wishing lantern with me again?

40:53.430 --> 40:54.230
Liu Shao.

40:55.280 --> 40:57.280
Do you remember what you wished for?

40:59.430 --> 41:01.490
May every day and night from now on be like this moment...

41:01.490 --> 41:02.290
Be now.

41:03.130 --> 41:04.310
Be now.

41:04.640 --> 41:05.780
May we stay together...

41:05.780 --> 41:07.120
May we stay together...

41:07.750 --> 41:08.500
Forever.

41:08.500 --> 41:09.890
Forever.

41:16.020 --> 41:16.990
I

41:17.450 --> 41:18.120
agree.

41:22.570 --> 41:23.370
In fact,

41:24.130 --> 41:25.350
we've made it.

41:26.100 --> 41:26.900
Look.

41:27.320 --> 41:28.620
We're together now.

41:30.260 --> 41:31.260
It's just that...

41:32.610 --> 41:34.000
my life...

41:35.380 --> 41:36.770
is a little short.

41:47.980 --> 41:49.370
Immortal Luo Ge

41:53.490 --> 41:55.250
kept the oath that day?

41:56.930 --> 41:57.940
How about

41:58.950 --> 42:00.250
Supreme God Luo Ge

42:01.130 --> 42:02.220
make a wish too?

42:03.940 --> 42:04.740
Okay.

42:07.850 --> 42:08.770
I make a wish.

42:09.700 --> 42:10.960
May we be together

42:11.080 --> 42:12.300
forever.

42:12.810 --> 42:14.070
May we never part

42:15.660 --> 42:16.670
day and night.

42:46.400 --> 42:47.410
Agree.

43:06.610 --> 43:07.490
Liu Shao.

43:09.460 --> 43:10.720
Since you agreed,

43:12.150 --> 43:13.240
I believe it.

43:16.100 --> 43:17.780
I'll wait for you forever.

43:18.410 --> 43:20.140
I'll wait for you day and night.

43:20.800 --> 43:22.460
You can't go back on your word.

43:23.780 --> 43:25.510
Don't keep me waiting too long.

43:25.880 --> 43:26.930
Okay?

43:30.330 --> 43:31.170
So...

43:31.170 --> 43:33.320
Supreme God Luo Ge left the Immortal Palace?

43:33.320 --> 43:33.900
Yes.

43:34.160 --> 43:35.690
After he cured Master Zhuo,

43:35.960 --> 43:37.010
he just left

43:37.180 --> 43:38.440
and never went back.

43:38.900 --> 43:40.100
Why didn't he go back?

43:40.390 --> 43:40.960
I heard

43:41.090 --> 43:43.660
♫This is a spring song♫

43:41.190 --> 43:43.950
he was looking for a bird with three feet.

43:43.950 --> 43:45.310
It's the Three-legged Golden Crow,

43:44.820 --> 43:47.300
♫The peach blossoms fly with the swallow♫

43:45.310 --> 43:47.500
the doppelganger of Supreme God Liu Shao.

43:47.500 --> 43:49.580
Someone said that Three-legged Golden Crow

43:48.390 --> 43:53.500
♫Whose lights are light and shine people's way home?♫

43:49.580 --> 43:51.870
was following Supreme God Luo Ge the whole time.

43:51.870 --> 43:53.260
But somehow

43:53.480 --> 43:55.150
Supreme God Luo Ge couldn't seem to see it

43:55.150 --> 43:55.900
and kept looking for it.

43:55.730 --> 43:58.420
♫The clouds roll the sunset♫

43:57.290 --> 44:00.160
No matter how many times it goes around,

43:59.500 --> 44:01.960
♫The moon kisses the eyebrows♫

44:00.420 --> 44:01.570
I will recognize you

44:01.960 --> 44:04.190
♫I am waiting for you to say♫

44:02.230 --> 44:03.490
and follow you

44:03.860 --> 44:05.070
forever.

44:04.190 --> 44:08.210
♫Tonight in this life♫

44:05.910 --> 44:06.970
You can't run away.

44:09.100 --> 44:13.020
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

44:10.070 --> 44:11.040
I won't run away.

44:11.690 --> 44:13.030
I'll never run away.

44:13.020 --> 44:16.600
♫I miss you so much♫

44:14.170 --> 44:15.950
You must follow me forever.

44:16.600 --> 44:19.070
♫I still remember the youth♫

44:16.620 --> 44:17.810
I won't lose you.

44:19.830 --> 44:23.180
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

44:23.960 --> 44:26.780
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

44:26.780 --> 44:28.710
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

44:29.070 --> 44:31.390
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

44:31.390 --> 44:34.200
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

44:34.540 --> 44:37.680
♫Send you to the Western State♫

44:38.810 --> 44:41.580
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

44:41.580 --> 44:43.870
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

44:43.870 --> 44:46.110
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

44:46.110 --> 44:47.130
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

44:47.130 --> 44:52.990
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

45:08.310 --> 45:11.130
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

45:11.130 --> 45:13.060
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

45:13.420 --> 45:15.740
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

45:15.740 --> 45:18.560
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

45:18.890 --> 45:22.030
♫Send you to the Western State♫

45:23.160 --> 45:25.930
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

45:25.930 --> 45:28.230
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

45:28.230 --> 45:30.460
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

45:30.460 --> 45:31.480
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

45:31.480 --> 45:37.340
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫
